type: software
title: "Seshat: Manuscript Annotation and Analysis Platform"
abstract: >-
  Seshat is a manuscript annotation and analysis platform combining a Vue
  frontend for image and PDF annotation, IIIF viewing, export, and
  scribe-analysis workflows with Python and Node.js backend services.
